	(text "Design notes (board B):\n- Power: USB-C VBUS and the GaggiMate cable (J2 pin1 +5V, pin4 GND, same pinout as the controller J4 display\n  connector) are OR-ed by two SS34 Schottkys into +5V (~4.6 V). +5V feeds DRV8311H VM/VIN_AVDD and the AP7361C-33ER LDO.\n- DRV8311H hardware variant: MODE tied to AVDD = 3x PWM mode (OCP 5 A). INHx = PWM from ESP32, all INLx tied to\n  DRV_EN (GPIO47, 100k pull-down -> outputs Hi-Z at boot). nSLEEP GPIO21 with 100k pull-down. GAIN pin open = Hi-Z\n  = 1 V/A CSA gain (+/-1.65 A range). SLEW 47k to GND = 75 V/us (dead time per datasheet). SOA/SOB -> GPIO1/GPIO2 (ADC1).\n- Panel QSPI lines have 33R series resistors at the ESP32 (wire bundle ~10-15 cm long).\n- Panel 3V3 (3V3_LCD) via AO3401A; firmware should keep LCD/TP pins low or Hi-Z while LCD_EN is low.\n- MT6701 SSI lines (ENC_CS/CLK/DO) have 2.2k pull-ups here (board A has none), as SmartKnob.\n- J7 (13 pads) and J6 (motor pads) are bare pads, not populated. Test pads TP1-TP7 are bare pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 520 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
